{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20139","headline":"送淡公 十二 · 孟郊","name":"送淡公 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗人苦爲诗，不如脱空飞。\n一生空鷕气，非谏复非讥。\n脱枯挂寒枝，弃如一唾微。\n一步一步乞，半片半片衣。\n倚诗爲活计，从古多无肥。\n诗饥老不怨，劳师泪霏霏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20139.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20139","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}